      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――之前的『樱花赏』上，伏特加\n以微小差距输给了大和赤骥。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c40b26d83682cb5a72bdd8336ce75e5fd07ee4d29861526abd393542a78a1f95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
