    {
      "uid": "zhcn:617202096d37b20cd17ec8fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两者相争，无人能及，\n那场比赛十分激烈，\n让人记忆犹新，深感她们未来可期。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dfb96138c88df28befe381d4018afab6e33bb24c5eb55b9f70ff4e78a86097d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
